<content>
<callout icon="📦" color="blue_bg">
	**Status: Proposed Freeze — Compilable Proto Baseline + Canonical Codec Contract.** 本页把 <mention-page url="https://app.notion.com/p/3c44c57a590c8161bd08d1dedd37ef5c"/> 与 <mention-page url="https://app.notion.com/p/3c44c57a590c81a1902be95a889f68e0"/> 转成 repository-level `.proto` baseline、无环 import graph、canonical writer/decoder contract 与 codegen boundary。本文冻结的是 **wire source layout + codec behavior + codegen discipline**；它不重新设计 Leaf Schema。Brush downstream RC-B06/B07/B08 已关闭，RichText font RC-B09 也已由 <mention-page url="https://app.notion.com/p/3c54c57a590c81d8befacf2228f81fd6"/> 关闭；当前仍不能伪装成 Final semantic freeze的主要事项集中在 hard-limit policy与其他 Freeze Review remaining gates。Shape / Image / Connector也已由各自 V1 release authority关闭。
</callout>
<table_of_contents/>
# 0. Authority / Scope
直接 authority：
- <mention-page url="https://app.notion.com/p/3c44c57a590c8161bd08d1dedd37ef5c"/> — Integrated Reference IDL
- <mention-page url="https://app.notion.com/p/3c44c57a590c81a1902be95a889f68e0"/> — Leaf Schema Reconciliation
- <mention-page url="https://app.notion.com/p/3c44c57a590c81f9a6d0e1ec2a9bcab7"/> — Common Wire Rules
- <mention-page url="https://app.notion.com/p/3c44c57a590c81d9a2eaf77cc4fb67c2"/> — Semantic Conformance + Golden Corpus
- <mention-page url="https://app.notion.com/p/3c44c57a590c81a89ac2d3dc36f16787"/> — Cross-language Conformance Runner
- <mention-page url="https://app.notion.com/p/3c44c57a590c81beadaeec834eb54fbd"/> — Golden Corpus Seed Set
本文解决四件事：
1. `.proto` 在 repo 里如何拆文件、命名、import；
2. 什么才是 Axiom canonical protobuf bytes；
3. generated C++ / TS types 能进入哪里、不能进入哪里；
4. schema/toolchain/descriptor/golden 如何进入 CI gate。
本文不解决：ResizeObjects / size+transform atomicity、RichText bidi/collaboration/shaping implementation compatibility 与 leaf-specific hard limits。BrushFamily numeric registry已由 <mention-page url="https://app.notion.com/p/3c44c57a590c8132ade5e6488e27a4df"/> 关闭；PRNG/Highlighter已由 <mention-page url="https://app.notion.com/p/3c54c57a590c81ffa7c5c6080fe940d4"/> 关闭；Pressure/Tilt已由 <mention-page url="https://app.notion.com/p/3c54c57a590c81d4a46ff149c10ceadd"/> 关闭；RichText font identity / weight / fallback已由 <mention-page url="https://app.notion.com/p/3c54c57a590c81d8befacf2228f81fd6"/> 关闭。上述 closure 均保持现有 proto field/tag structure不变。Connector delete referential integrity + anchor/port contract 已由 <mention-page url="https://app.notion.com/p/3c44c57a590c817384dedc221b023bde"/> 关闭。ShapeKind registry 已由 <mention-page url="https://app.notion.com/p/3c44c57a590c81c0ab80d6a8d6aa0778"/> 关闭；Image canonical geometry/presence 已由 <mention-page url="https://app.notion.com/p/3c44c57a590c81948870c4f266a39861"/> 关闭。
# 1. Contract Stack
<callout icon="🔒" color="green_bg">
	**GP-01：Axiom V1 wire contract 不是单独一份 ****`.proto`****。Normative contract = semantic authority + ****`.proto`**** structural schema + ****`canonical_profile_v1.yaml`**** + canonical validator/normalizer + golden binary corpus。**
</callout>
```plain text
Semantic / Leaf Authorities
        ↓
.proto structural schema
        +
canonical_profile_v1.yaml
        ↓
Generated DTOs
        ↓
Axiom Wire Preflight
        ↓
Normalize + Semantic Validate
        ↓
Axiom Canonical Protobuf Writer
        ↓
Canonical protobuf bytes
        ↓
Golden Corpus / C++-TS-WASM Conformance
```
官方 Protobuf 文档明确说明 protobuf serialization 本身不提供 canonical serialization；`deterministic` serialization 也不能替代跨版本/跨语言 canonical contract。因此 canonical byte authority 必须留在 Axiom profile 与 golden corpus，而不是某个 runtime serializer。[Protocol Buffers: Serialization is not canonical](https://protobuf.dev/programming-guides/serialization-not-canonical/)
# 2. Proto Language Baseline
<callout icon="🔒" color="green_bg">
	**GP-02：V1 source schema 使用 Protobuf Edition 2024。所有文件统一 ****`edition = "2024";`**** 与 ****`package auditoryworks.axiom.v1;`****。**
</callout>
选择 Edition 2024 的直接收益：
- singular scalar / enum / string / bytes 默认 **EXPLICIT presence**；
- repeated primitive 默认 PACKED；
- 同一 Edition feature set 能被 C++ 与现代 ES generator共同消费；
- 后续 Edition 升级可以独立于 Axiom `schema_version` 管理。
参考：[Edition 2024 specification](https://protobuf.dev/reference/protobuf/edition-2024-spec/)；[Editions feature settings](https://protobuf.dev/editions/features/)；[Version support](https://protobuf.dev/support/version-support/)。
## 2.1 Presence policy
Edition source **不使用 proto3 ****`optional`**** 关键字**。例如：
```protobuf
edition = "2024";
package auditoryworks.axiom.v1;

message Placement {
  Id128 parent_id = 1;   // absent = document root
  OrderKey order_key = 2;
}
```
在 Edition 2024 下 `parent_id` 已有 explicit presence。
<callout icon="🔒" color="green_bg">
	**GP-03：Axiom 不使用 ****`LEGACY_REQUIRED`**** / proto2 required。** “字段必须存在”是 semantic validator rule，不由 parser-level required 制造不可演进的 wire obligation。
</callout>
因此：
- `Placement.parent_id`：presence 本身有语义，absent=root；
- `ImageContent.source_rect`：optional；absent ≡ exact FullRect，canonical full rect elide 为 absent；`ImageContent.content_mode`：semantic-required、无 default；`ImageContent.width/height`：semantic-required、finite `>0`；authority = <mention-page url="https://app.notion.com/p/3c44c57a590c81948870c4f266a39861"/>；
- `TextStyle.font_resource_id` 已由 <mention-page url="https://app.notion.com/p/3c54c57a590c81d8befacf2228f81fd6"/> 冻结为 V1 semantic-required、non-zero，且不存在 schema-level default font；`BrushDescriptor.texture_resource_id` presence继续由 Brush authority定义；`StrokeSample.pressure` 对 V1 VectorStroke semantic-required；`StrokeSample.tilt` 已由 <mention-page url="https://app.notion.com/p/3c54c57a590c81d4a46ff149c10ceadd"/> 冻结为当前 V1 released families必须 absent；PressureMapping/TiltMapping 的 explicit `enabled=false` presence必须保留；`AutoPerimeterAnchor.hint` 已由 <mention-page url="https://app.notion.com/p/3c44c57a590c817384dedc221b023bde"/> 关闭 Review：absent = dynamic auto-facing，present = explicit normalized directional preference，二者不等价；
- 对 `schema_version`、ObjectRecord content 等 semantic-required 字段，absent 由 Axiom validator reject。
## 2.2 Enum policy
<callout icon="🔒" color="green_bg">
	**GP-04：protobuf parser 层保留 Edition 默认 OPEN enum；Axiom semantic validator 对 unknown numeric enum fail-closed。** 不把 protobuf CLOSED enum 当成 Axiom semantic policy。
</callout>
理由：generated DTO 只负责忠实承载 wire numeric value；是否属于当前 Axiom registry 由 semantic authority判断。Unknown enum 不能进入 committed document，但也不应因语言 runtime 的 closed-enum unknown-field处理差异成为第二套语义。
# 3. Repository Layout v0.1
<callout icon="🔒" color="green_bg">
	**GP-05：V1 不使用单一巨大 ****`axiom.proto`****；使用一个 package、多个 ownership file、显式 direct import 的 acyclic module graph。**
</callout>
```plain text
schema/axiom/v1/
├── proto/
│   └── auditoryworks/axiom/v1/
│       ├── common.proto
│       ├── geometry.proto
│       ├── paint.proto
│       ├── property.proto
│       ├── vector_path.proto
│       ├── brush_stroke.proto
│       ├── erase_mask.proto
│       ├── rich_text.proto
│       ├── connector.proto
│       ├── object.proto
│       ├── operation.proto
│       └── snapshot.proto
├── canonical/
│   └── canonical_profile_v1.yaml
├── registry/
│   ├── field_registry_v1.yaml
│   ├── shape_kind_registry_v1.yaml
│   └── brush_family_registry_v1.yaml   # family/version + BI interpreter metadata
├── descriptor/
│   └── axiom_v1.descriptor.pb
└── toolchain/
    └── baseline.yaml
```
Generated code放在 repo 的 generated/build area，例如：
```plain text
generated/
├── cpp/axiom/v1/...
└── ts/axiom/v1/...
```
generated output 是 derived artifact，不是 schema authority，不允许手改。
# 4. Import DAG
```mermaid
