# ImageContent Proto / Canonical Profile Reconciliation
Authority：<mention-page url="https://app.notion.com/p/3c44c57a590c81948870c4f266a39861"/>。
Edition 2024 `object.proto` 的 ImageContent现已 append `width=6 / height=7`；tags 1–5 不变。`canonical_profile_v1.yaml` 必须增加：
```yaml
ImageContent.source_rect:
  presence: OPTIONAL
  semantic_default: FULL_RECT
  absent_equals_default: true
  canonical_default_encoding: ABSENT
  validation: normalized_rect_positive_extent

ImageContent.content_mode:
  presence: REQUIRED
  allowed: [FIT, FILL, STRETCH]
  unknown: REJECT

ImageContent.width:
  presence: REQUIRED
  scalar: F64
  validation: finite_gt_zero

ImageContent.height:
  presence: REQUIRED
  scalar: F64
  validation: finite_gt_zero
```
`intrinsic_width/height` 同样 semantic-required + finite_gt_zero，但其 coordinate domain 是 source plane metadata，不是 object-local Document Unit。
这次结构 append预期改变 normalized FileDescriptorSet 与 SchemaFingerprint；CI 不得把旧 fingerprint继续视为 current，也不得自动更新 lock。必须走 explicit descriptor-lock-update、codegen refresh、BG/BGX review、C++/TS/WASM conformance后再接受新 lock。
